EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hi {!QCC_First_Host__c.QCC_First_Host_First_Name__c},

As a Qantas {!QCC_First_Host__c.QCC_Frequent_Flyer_Tier_Formula__c} member, the Qantas VIP Service Team is dedicated to overseeing your Qantas travel and ensuring that you have the smoothest journey possible. We've reviewed your upcoming booking on {!QCC_First_Host__c.QCC_Carrier_Code__c}{!QCC_First_Host__c.QCC_Flight_No__c} and can confirm that your booking is in order. {!IF(NOT(ISBLANK(QCC_First_Host__c.QCC_Seat_Number__c)), "Your current seat is "+ QCC_First_Host__c.QCC_Seat_Number__c+".","")}

Remember, the Qantas VIP Service Team is at your service by phoning + 61 2 6122 1111.
